{"messages":[{"text":"🟢 T1 · Carreras\nÁlvaro Carreras provocó el penalti del 1-0 y marcó el 2-0 del Madrid ante el Rayo tras combinar con Mbappé. 🌶️ Carreras convirtió el lateral izquierdo en carril de adelantamiento.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%9F%A2%20T1%20%C2%B7%20Carreras%0A%C3%81lvaro%20Carreras%20provoc%C3%B3%20el%20penalti%20del%201-0%20y%20marc%C3%B3%20el%202-0%20del%20Madrid%20ante%20el%20Rayo%20tras%20combinar%20con%20Mbapp%C3%A9.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Carreras%20convirti%C3%B3%20el%20lateral%20izquierdo%20en%20carril%20de%20adelantamiento."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%9F%A2%20T1%20%C2%B7%20Carreras%0A%C3%81lvaro%20Carreras%20provoc%C3%B3%20el%20penalti%20del%201-0%20y%20marc%C3%B3%20el%202-0%20del%20Madrid%20ante%20el%20Rayo%20tras%20combinar%20con%20Mbapp%C3%A9.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Provoc%C3%B3%20uno%20y%20marc%C3%B3%20otro%3A%20para%20ser%20defensa%2C%20ven%C3%ADa%20con%20demasiados%20extras."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%9F%A2%20T1%20%C2%B7%20Carreras%0A%C3%81lvaro%20Carreras%20provoc%C3%B3%20el%20penalti%20del%201-0%20y%20marc%C3%B3%20el%202-0%20del%20Madrid%20ante%20el%20Rayo%20tras%20combinar%20con%20Mbapp%C3%A9.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Le%20dieron%20toda%20la%20banda%20y%20acab%C3%B3%20entrando%20tambi%C3%A9n%20en%20el%20marcador."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%9F%A2%20T1%20%C2%B7%20Carreras%0A%C3%81lvaro%20Carreras%20provoc%C3%B3%20el%20penalti%20del%201-0%20y%20marc%C3%B3%20el%202-0%20del%20Madrid%20ante%20el%20Rayo%20tras%20combinar%20con%20Mbapp%C3%A9.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Carreras%20hizo%20de%20lateral%20y%20goleador.%20El%20Rayo%20a%C3%BAn%20busca%20d%C3%B3nde%20se%20desactiva%20ese%20paquete."}],"search_terms":["Carreras"]},{"text":"🟢 T2 · #FIBAWWC\nEspaña cae 76-66 ante Estados Unidos en la semifinal del Mundi